        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is already possible via buffer-local variables. See [this section in help file](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/34acb9bd6d2f88c57d21f6a261ddba6a740651f7/doc/mini-trailspace.txt#L35-L43).\r\n\r\nAdding something like this should remove highlighting in 'lazy.nvim' buffer:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.api.nvim_create_autocmd('FileType', {\r\n  pattern = 'lazy',\r\n  callback = function(data)\r\n    vim.b[data.buf].minitrailspace_disable = true\r\n    vim.api.nvim_buf_call(data.buf, MiniTrailspace.unhighlight)\r\n  end,\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nSomewhat a duplicate of #52 and others.",
            "created_at": "2023-07-18T11:19:47Z",
